 (text "REAL NET-LABEL CONNECTIVITY. SOURCE VIN_FUSED is externally cable-fused. AUX VIN_PROTECTED_UNFUSED IS NOT BRANCH-FUSED ON THIS PCB. LM74930 IS A SHARED ELECTRONIC CIRCUIT BREAKER; EXTERNAL REPLACEABLE BRANCH FUSE AND FAULT-RATED INTERBOARD CONNECTION REQUIRED. KEEP RTN25 FLOAT." (at 31.75 16.51 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "f1512578-cc72-4c26-bf70-000000001330"))
 (text "STOP GATES: Q301 202V SOA / HOT 2.4A; VS-R313-315 0.75J 350ms; 9V VS BOOT; NO ON-MODULE BRANCH FUSE; EXTERNAL FUSE MANDATORY; J301/J302 POWER; OV/UV/COPPER/ISO. EN DEFAULT: populate R319 only for STANDALONE; TripTracer uses external 3.3V conditioned RUN_CMD." (at 31.75 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "f1512578-cc72-4c26-bf70-000000001331"))
 (text "Top: power FETs / controller; below: grouped discrete protection with explicit real nets. INPUT FUSED: J301.1, unfused protected-source VIN_PROTECTED_UNFUSED at J302.1; fuse on TripTracer board as first downstream element, 5V at J302.2." (at 31.75 35.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "f1512578-cc72-4c26-bf70-000000001332"))
